    "question": "Given your background in General IT, you've likely encountered various technical issues. Could you share a straightforward technical problem you've faced – it could be anything from a networking glitch to a software configuration issue – and walk me through how you approached diagnosing and ultimately resolving it? We're really interested in your logical thought process here.",
    "category": "Problem Solving",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "expectedTopics": ["Troubleshooting steps", "Logical reasoning", "Problem identification", "Basic debugging"]
